  "description": "Once a slave, Lev is unexpectedly freed by a passing nobleman named Nox and brought into his household to start a new life of quiet stability. \n\nBut everything begins to shift the night Lev shares a bed with Arad, Nox’s close friend. \n\nFrom that moment on, the balance between the three begins to twist, tangle, and unravel, turning the mansion into something far more complicated than a place of refuge. \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
